          "title": "KL divergence to MLE",
          "mustKnow": "Know the algebra connecting distribution matching to log-likelihood.",
          "coreIdea": "Minimizing KL from data to model is equivalent to maximizing expected model log-likelihood because the data entropy term is constant in theta.",
          "formulaOrRule": "Forward KL decomposes into a constant minus expected log likelihood.",
          "formula": "KL(p_{data}\\Vert p_\\theta)=\\mathbb{E}_{p_{data}}[\\log p_{data}(x)-\\log p_\\theta(x)]",
          "formulaHtml": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mi>K</mi><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub><mi>&#x02016;</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>&#x003B8;</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><msub><mi>&#x1D53C;</mi><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>log</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mi>log</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>&#x003B8;</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></math>",
          "commonTrap": "Do not drop the direction of KL; reverse KL has different behavior and is not this derivation.",
