          "formulaOrRule": "The covariance is low-rank structure plus isotropic noise.",
          "formula": "x\\sim\\mathcal{N}(\\mu,WW^T+\\sigma^2I)",
          "formulaHtml": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>&#x0007E;</mi><mi>&#x1D4A9;</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>&#x003BC;</mi><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mi>W</mi><msup><mi>W</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><msup><mi>&#x003C3;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></math>",
          "commonTrap": "Do not treat PPCA as ordinary deterministic PCA; it is a likelihood model with noise.",
          "examUse": "Use PPCA as the clean bridge from linear latent models to VAEs.",
