        "type": "mechanism",
        "cardType": "mechanism",
        "front": "What is the formula, rule, or mechanism for KL divergence to MLE?",
        "answer": "Forward KL decomposes into a constant minus expected log likelihood.",
        "explanation": "Minimizing KL from data to model is equivalent to maximizing expected model log-likelihood because the data entropy term is constant in theta."
