        "type": "why",
        "cardType": "why-it-matters",
        "front": "Why does ELBO and gap matter in the course logic?",
        "answer": "The ELBO lower-bounds log likelihood; the gap is a KL divergence between the approximate posterior and true posterior.",
        "explanation": "Connect it forward: Use this concept to connect EM, VI, and VAEs."
