        "difficulty": "exam",
        "prompt": "An exam question is testing Probabilistic PCA. What should your answer include, and what trap should you avoid?",
        "answer": "Include: Use PPCA as the clean bridge from linear latent models to VAEs. Avoid: Do not treat PPCA as ordinary deterministic PCA; it is a likelihood model with noise.",
