        "prompt": "How do we overcome this in practice?",
        "promptHtml": "<p>How do we overcome this in practice?</p>",
        "answer": "Perturb the data with Gaussian noise and learn scores of the smoothed noisy distributions, often at multiple noise levels. This is denoising score matching / noise-conditional score modelling.",
        "answerHtml": "<p>Perturb the data with Gaussian noise and learn scores of the smoothed noisy distributions, often at multiple noise levels. This is denoising score matching / noise-conditional score modelling.</p>",
