        "promptHtml": "<p>The formulation of perplexity is</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Display formula\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><msub><mo>Perplexity</mo><mi>&#x003B8;</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mi>exp</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#x02211;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></msubsup><mi>log</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>&#x003B8;</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&#x02223;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mi>&#x02026;</mi><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mo stretchy=\"true\" fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow><mo>&#x0002E;</mo></mrow></math></div>\n<p>What does perplexity measure? Is higher better or lower better? Explain your reasoning.</p>",
